itialize Firebase Data Connect\n- [x] Set up Auth.js (NextAuth.js v5) with Firebase Auth\n- [x] Create base layout (Sidebar, Header, Breadcrumbs)\n- [x] Set up GitHub Actions deployment workflow (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`)\n- [ ] Install dependencies (npm install - requires user to run)"}},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_use_id":"toolu_01CF6rfkmVHScnzPk4urvMTo","tool_input":{"file_path":"/home/ross/Documents/hardware_project_planning/@fix_plan.md","old_string":"## Phase 2: Schema & CRUD (High Priority)\n- [ ] Define Data Connect schema in `dataconnect/schema.gql`\n  - [ ] Organization, User, Portfolio, Program, Project entities\n  - [ ] PhaseTemplate, PhaseTemplatePhase entities\n  - [ ] ProductType, ProductTypePhaseConfig entities\n  - [ ] Team, TeamMember entities\n- [ ] Generate TypeScript SDK from Data Connect\n- [ ] Implement Portfolio CRUD operations\n- [ ] Implement Program CRUD operations\n- [ ] Implement Project CRUD operations\n- [ ] Implement Product Type management","new_string":"## Phase 2: Schema & CRUD (High Priority)\n- [x] Define Data Connect schema in `dataconnect/schema.gql`\n  - [x] Organization, User, Portfolio, Program, Project entities\n  - [x] PhaseTemplate, PhaseTemplatePhase entities\n  - [x] ProductType, ProductTypePhaseConfig entities\n  - [x] Team, TeamMember entities\n- [ ] Create Data Connect operations (GraphQL queries/mutations)\n- [ ] Generate TypeScript SDK from Data Connect\n- [ ] Implement Portfolio CRUD operations\n- [ ] Implement Program CRUD operations\n- [ ] Implement Project CRUD operations\n- [ ] Implement Product Type management"}},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_use_id":"toolu_01AZBxvyxpKtPVpTqX5BcHfF","tool_input":{"file_path":"/home/ross/Documents/hardware_project_planning/@fix_plan.md","old_string":"## Testing\n- [ ] Set up Vitest for unit tests\n- [ ] Set up Playwright for E2E tests\n- [ ] Write unit tests for allocation math\n- [ ] Write unit tests for phase generation\n- [ ] Write integration tests for Data Connect operations\n- [ ] Write E2E test: Create project → assign resources → view timeline","new_string":"## Testing\n- [x] Set up Vitest for unit tests\n- [x] Set up Playwright for E2E tests\n- [ ] Write unit tests for allocation math\n- [ ] Write unit tests for phase generation\n- [ ] Write integration tests for Data Connect operations\n- [ ] Write E2E test: Create project → assign resources → view timeline"}},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_use_id":"toolu_012an4gpfGP3V4UJ15j2NQrD","tool_input":{"file_path":"/home/ross/Documents/hardware_project_planning/@fix_plan.md","old_string":"## Completed\n- [x] Project initialization\n- [x] Firebase-based architecture selected\n- [x] Requirements documentation (specs/requirements.md)","new_string":"## Completed\n- [x] Project initialization\n- [x] Firebase-based architecture selected\n- [x] Requirements documentation (specs/requirements.md)\n- [x] Next.js App Router structure created\n- [x] Tailwind CSS configured with shadcn/ui design tokens\n- [x] Firebase configuration files (firebase.json, .firebaserc)\n- [x] Data Connect schema defined with all entities\n- [x] Auth.js (NextAuth v5) configuration\n- [x] Base UI components (Button, Card, Separator, DropdownMenu)\n- [x] Layout components (Sidebar, Header, Breadcrumbs, AppLayout)\n- [x] Dashboard page with sample KPI cards\n- [x] GitHub Actions deployment workflow\n- [x] Test configuration (Vitest, Playwright)\n- [x] ESLint and Prettier configuration\n- [x] TypeScript configuration with path aliases\n- [x] Utility functions (cn, formatDate, fiscal year helpers, allocation validators)"}},{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_use_id":"toolu_01PDhEFwSxtJhcH2P3ciBPyx","tool_input":{"file_path":"/home/ross/Documents/hardware_project_planning/README.md","old_string":"# Hardware NPI Planning App\n","new_string":"# Hardware NPI Planning Webapp\n\nA comprehensive hardware NPI (New Product Introduction) planning web application built with Next.js and Firebase. The system supports portfolio → program → project hierarchies, customizable NPI phase templates, and percentage-based resource planning with fiscal-year awareness.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Portfolio Management**: Multi-level hierarchy (Portfolio → Program → Project)\n- **NPI Phase Templates**: Customizable templates (EVT/DVT/PVT/MP) with per-project phases\n- **Resource Planning**: Percentage-based allocations (0-100%) with over-allocation detection\n- **Timeline View**: Gantt-style project timeline with fiscal/calendar year toggle\n- **Resource Management**: Organization-wide resource tracking and capacity summary\n- **Executive Dashboard**: KPI tracking and portfolio visibility\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n| Layer | Technology |\n|-------|------------|\n| Framework | Next.js 14+ (App Router) |\n| Language | TypeScript |\n| Platform | Firebase (Hosting, Auth, Data Connect) |\n| Database | Firebase Data Connect (Cloud SQL – PostgreSQL) |\n| Auth | NextAuth.js v5 (Auth.js) + Firebase Auth |\n| UI | shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS |\n| Tables | TanStack Table v8 |\n| Charts | Recharts + D3 |\n| State | TanStack Query + Zustand |\n| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod |\n| Testing | Vitest + Playwright |\n| CI/CD | GitHub Actions → Firebase Hosting |\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- npm or yarn\n- Firebase account\n- Firebase CLI (`npm install -g firebase-tools`)\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Clone the repository\n```bash\ngit clone <repository-url>\ncd hardware_project_planning\n```\n\n2. Install dependencies\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n3. Set up environment variables\n```bash\ncp .env.example .env.local\n```\n\nEdit `.env.local` with your Firebase credentials:\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY`\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN`\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID`\n- And other Firebase config values\n\n4. Initialize Firebase (if not already done)\n```bash\nfirebase login\nfirebase init\n```\n\n5. Generate Data Connect SDK\n```bash\nfirebase dataconnect:sdk:generate\n```\n\n6. Start the development server\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nOpen [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) to view the app.\n\n## Available Scripts\n\n```bash\nnpm run dev          # Start development server\nnpm run build        # Build for production\nnpm run start        # Start production server\nnpm run lint         # Run ESLint\nnpm run type-check   # Run TypeScript compiler check\nnpm test             # Run Vitest unit tests\nnpm run test:ui      # Run Vitest with UI\nnpm run test:coverage # Run tests with coverage\nnpm run test:e2e     # Run Playwright E2E tests\nnpm run test:e2e:ui  # Run Playwright with UI\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── app/                    # Next.js App Router pages\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/                 # shadcn/ui components\n│   ├── layout/             # Layout components (Sidebar, Header, etc.)\n│   ├── visualizations/     # Charts, Gantt, Timeline\n│   └── shared/             # Shared components\n├── services/               # Business logic and API services\n├── hooks/                  # Custom React hooks\n├── store/                  # Zustand stores\n├── types/                  # TypeScript type definitions\n└── lib/                    # Utilities and helpers\n\ndataconnect/\n├── schema.gql              # Data Connect schema (SOURCE OF TRUTH)\n├── operations/             # GraphQL queries and mutations\n└── generated/              # Generated TypeScript SDK\n\ntests/\n├── unit/                   # Vitest unit tests\n├── integration/            # Integration tests\n└── e2e/                    # Playwright E2E tests\n```\n\n## Data Model\n\n```\nOrganization\n├─ User (roles: ADMIN, MANAGER, MEMBER, VIEWER)\n├─ Portfolio\n│  └─ Program\n│     └─ Project\n│        ├─ ProjectPhase\n│        └─ ProjectAssignment\n├─ PhaseTemplate\n│  └─ PhaseTemplatePhase\n├─ ProductType\n│  └─ ProductTypePhaseConfig\n├─ Team\n   └─ TeamMember\n```\n\n## Key Principles\n\n- **Data Connect is the single source of truth** (no Prisma)\n- All allocations are percentage-based (0-100)\n- All assignments must have date ranges\n- Fiscal year start month is configurable per Organization\n- Phase templates are copied into projects at creation time\n\n## Development Workflow\n\n1. Make changes to the code\n2. Run type check: `npm run type-check`\n3. Run linter: `npm run lint`\n4. Run tests: `npm test`\n5. Build for production: `npm run build`\n6. Commit and push (triggers GitHub Actions deployment)\n\n## Deployment\n\nThe app automatically deploys to Firebase Hosting when changes are pushed to the `main` branch via GitHub Actions.\n\n### Manual Deployment\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\nnpx next export\nfirebase deploy --only hosting\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n### Unit Tests (Vitest)\n```bash\nnpm test                  # Run tests\nnpm run test:ui          # Run with UI\nnpm run test:coverage    # Generate coverage report\n```\n\n### E2E Tests (Playwright)\n```bash\nnpm run test:e2e         # Run E2E tests\nnpm run test:e2e:ui      # Run with UI\n```\n\n## Contributing\n\n1. Create a feature branch\n2. Make your changes\n3. Run tests and linting\n4. Submit a pull request\n\n## License\n\nSee LICENSE file for details.\n\n## Documentation\n\n- [Requirements](specs/requirements.md) - Complete product requirements\n- [Setup Guide](SETUP_COMPLETE.md) - Phase 1 setup documentation\n- [Agent Instructions](@AGENT.md) - Build and development instructions\n- [Fix Plan](@fix_plan.md) - Prioritized TODO list\n"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01QrJj97Do8wnfHqbJTRXP6D","tool_input":{"command":"tree -L 3 -I node_modules /home/ross/Documents/hardware_project_planning/src 2>/dev/null || find /home/ross/Documents/hardware_project_planning/src -type f | head -30","description":"Show project structure"}}],"uuid":"fead17b5-e175-447f-a127-8c44eb073667"}
